Confirmed timeout also retains its existing distinct terminated-timeout source contract. A preceding independently evidenced LimitedRepair choice in recoverGoalPhaseValidation returns limited-repair-preparation-required and leaves the original Decision unchanged. After bounded diagnosis/planning, supply a captured concrete proposal here; that selection grants no adoption of an unknown future Plan. Only separately independently authorized adoptGoalPhaseFailedPhaseRepair and later ordinary Advance issue the corrective Step. Known-error and suspected-hang investigation must use actual start/end observations, retained output and diagnostic stack/process evidence when needed; timeout alone or the last printed test does not establish a hang or current-test identity. CNCF owns execution and result interpretation.

Also admit the distinct confirmed TimedOut/incomplete whole-Phase source through explicit v2 target source.kind=terminated-timeout. Bind actual Session, workflow identity/revision, participant, Plan identity/revision, original base, exact candidate, original validation source/current Decision revisions, unique check identity/ordinal, terminal attempt ordinal and actual intent/result/final receipt identities/revisions with timed-out/incomplete facts. Share ordinary contiguous actual-attempt reconciliation with the unchanged known-failed v1 proof. Never use failure-proof fallback, manufacture KnownFailedPhase, convert exit143 or infer completed evidence from partial output. Launch not started, missing/UNKNOWN result, cancelled, termination-unconfirmed, other incomplete, multi-check, Step/review/closure/pending-repair frontiers refuse. The remaining complete Plan/proposal/ownership/check/fixed closure eligibility below applies to both explicit sources.

Passively traverse retained native history to the exact current unsuspended Decision from one genuinely terminated nonzero failed whole-Phase SBT check after all accepted Steps. Capture the raw complete proposal and effective acceptance; bind the original known-failed recovery target, complete Plan, accepted prefix, repair counters, generation, current candidatePaths, complete native Step closure policy and selected corrective checks. Require unchanged Plan identity, Phase, repository, repair limit, Phase checks, Phase review classification and raw/effective acceptance, a fresh revision and exactly one nonempty new Step depending on every original Step. Corrective ownership requires an exact current host candidatePaths entry for every owned path, including any explicitly selected test file outside original Step scopes; directory coverage alone refuses. Require a valid current closure installation with a fixed StepProgram mapping the appended Step identity before description or adoption. Unknown, Step, multi-check, reviewed, suspended, document-backed, unmapped or crossed frontiers refuse. Choices are exactly AdoptRepairPlan and Defer. No source read, Git, SBT, observation, work issuance or transition occurs; a description is not a Human answer.

