#### adoptGoalPhaseFailedPhaseRepair

##### DESCRIPTION

Any earlier LimitedRepair selection authorizes bounded investigation/preparation only. Independently authorize this exact captured concrete proposal and target; no earlier selection adopts a future Plan, authorizes retry or establishes check success. The unchanged original timeout Decision remains the source for existing interrupted-target proof. Only this adopted Plan may issue its corrective Step through a later separate ordinary Advance.

The distinct source.kind=terminated-timeout uses schema sm-workflow.goal-phase-failed-phase-repair-adoption.v2; the known-failed v1 schema/meaning below remains unchanged. Dispatch by the actual typed terminal source and explicit schema only. Reconstruct the original timeout with its complete bound target/proposal at the historical Decision and exact adjacent CAS successor. Require a new actual Human binding; old or crossed participant/reference/issuer/time/proposal evidence refuses. Preserve timeout/incomplete and partial diagnostic receipts, all accepted Steps/commits/reviews/base and repair counters/limit. Reuse only the existing failed-phase-repair-adopted pure eligibility edge with generation+1. Defer writes nothing; adoption saves one Direction with no Git/File/SBT/Start/Submit/Advance effects. A later separate ordinary Advance issues the corrective Step. General Decision resumption and same-candidate R8 recovery remain unchanged and continue to refuse timeout.

Require independently issued goal-phase-failed-phase-repair-adoption evidence for the exact complete failedPhaseRepairAdoption target and answer(choice,rationale,participant,reference), with actual issuer and time. Reconstruct the current bound failure, Plan, captured proposal, ownership, complete closure policy with the corrective Step fixed commit mapping, and checks; stale, repeated, missing, explicit-null, unknown-field or crossed contracts refuse. Retained reconstruction requires the same complete closure policy and mapping. Defer requires genuine evidence and writes nothing. AdoptRepairPlan appends one guarded mechanical Direction through the fixed Advance binding at session:ordered-failed-phase-repair-adoption:DecisionRevision@1, schema sm-workflow.goal-phase-failed-phase-repair-adoption.v1, with lifecycle edge failed-phase-repair-adopted Decision to Implementation. Retain original native history, completed Steps, commits, reviews, base and repair counters. Clear active candidate/check/review/closure/decision projections and increment generation once. A later separate ordinary advanceGoalPhase issues ImplementStep for the new corrective Step and retains the standard candidate, check, independent review, local Step commit and whole-Phase continuation. This Operation saves direction only and grants no Git/File/SBT/Submit/Advance effect or actual Human answer by itself. Existing same-candidate R8 validation recovery is unchanged.

