## JournalService

### DESCRIPTION

Read an immutable development Journal entry or find finite summaries from the exact host-declared managed collection. These commands record no Journal and accept no storage selectors or arbitrary Entry data. Finding, ExecutionObservation and EvidenceStorageObservation revision 1 are supported, with exactly one content variant selected by kind and canonical identity prefix.

