JournalReadResult

#### findJournalEntries

##### DESCRIPTION

Find at most 20 immutable Journal summaries in required repository scope through the fixed host-declared managed collection. Optional exact Phase, session, kind and complete source filters and whole-second UTC time bounds are pushed into the query before its limit. Physical ID ascending order is stable, not time ranking. hasMore asks the caller to refine filters and makes no count or completeness claim. Only found returns summaries; invalid, disabled and unavailable return none. Select readJournalEntry for complete detail. No Journal or Work is created.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

JournalFindInput

