#### prepareEvidence

##### DESCRIPTION

GoalPhase kind review-purpose-repair requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseReviewPurposeRepairDescriptionResult as request and GoalPhaseReviewPurposeRepairInput as result, matching directive reference and execution worker, and explicit acknowledgment of the complete saved original-purpose defect batch. Preparation records separately observed actual Human provenance under goal-phase-review-purpose-repair; it neither grants that consent nor admits a continuation nor rewrites the original review or unanswered question.

GoalPhase kind failed-phase-repair-adoption requires participant, the actual generated GoalPhaseFailedPhaseRepairDescriptionResult as request and GoalPhaseFailedPhaseRepairAdoptionInput as result, exact target/proposal/choice/reference and matching execution worker. Accept unchanged known-failed v1 targets or the distinct complete v2 source.kind=terminated-timeout target from that actual description. Never manufacture KnownFailedPhase or infer a completed result from partial output. Prepare only the independently observed actual new Human direction under purpose goal-phase-failed-phase-repair-adoption and exact failedPhaseRepairAdoption(target,answer) binding, with actual participant, reference, issuer and time. Choices are AdoptRepairPlan and Defer. The returned native external-evidence StartupImport rows neither provision storage nor adopt a Plan nor continue a Workflow. Unknown/missing/explicit-null target, direction or binding fields refuse; no legacy kind or fallback is supported.

GoalPhase kind validation-repair-adoption requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseValidationRepairDescriptionResult and full GoalPhaseValidationRepairAdoptionInput. Bind exactly componentInstance and validationRepairAdoption(target,proposal,answer(choice,rationale,participant,reference)) under native-external-evidence.v7 with actual issuer/time. Historical source uses only AdoptHistoricalAssociationAndRepairPlanAcceptingUnresolvedEffects or Defer and retains exact original public caller provenance and all fixed historical limitations. Preparation does not authenticate source, create Human authority, provision storage, adopt or Advance.

GoalPhase kind completion-policy-adoption requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseCompletionPolicyDescriptionResult as request and GoalPhaseCompletionPolicyAdoptionInput as result, the exact described target and matching independent Human reference and execution worker. Prepare the existing external-evidence import under purpose goal-phase-completion-policy-adoption and completionPolicyAdoption(target,answer). Choices are AdoptLocalCompletion and Defer. Preparation neither adopts direction nor changes a saved Start nor grants repository effects; the public adoption operation owns its guarded self-transition.

GoalPhase kind repair-policy-adoption requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseRepairPolicyDescriptionResult and GoalPhaseRepairPolicyAdoptionInput, exact target/choice/rationale/reference and matching independent worker, issuer and time. Prepare only the existing external-evidence import under goal-phase-repair-policy-adoption and repairPolicyAdoption(target,answer). Choices are AdoptRuntimePolicy, RetainSelectedLimit and Defer. Preparation has no workflow or authority effect and does not authenticate caller-origin claims. Optional restoration is exact business context; no consumer operation or count modification follows.

GoalPhase kind source-history-normalization requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseSourceHistoryNormalizationDescriptionResult and GoalPhaseSourceHistoryNormalizationAnswer, matching execution worker, actual existing policy-direction artifact reference, issuer and time. Bind the complete strict target and answer including priorExecutionEnded under the dedicated goal-phase-source-history-normalization purpose. AdoptSameAuthorityNormalization requires priorExecutionEnded=true independently attested by the trusted host from actual terminal evidence. Passive preparation verifies supplied typed data only; it does not prove termination, invent consent, answer the old Human, provision storage, adopt policy or Advance. No old source-history-recovery purpose or generic authorization fallback is admitted.

RepositorySync kind validation-continuation requires participant, the actual RepositorySyncValidationContinuationDescriptionResult and strict RepositorySyncValidationContinuationAnswer, matching execution worker, existing direction artifact reference, issuer and time. Bind every target/answer field under dedicated repository-sync-validation-continuation purpose. An adopting answer requires independently host-attested priorExecutionEnded=true and acceptOriginalUncertainty=true. The trusted host must verify actual terminal or not-started lifecycle externally before provisioning; live or unknown termination refuses. Passive preparation only encodes supplied facts: it cannot observe termination, manufacture consent, issue/provision evidence, adopt or execute. The old UNKNOWN effects remain unknown.

Passively prepare the explicitly selected Evidence input. Read only the declared absolute local file: URI references in the executing call. GoalPhase kind candidate-recovery requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseCandidateRecoveryDescriptionResult as request and GoalPhaseCandidateRecoveryAnswer as result, with matching execution worker and actual reference, for a separately bound new remaining candidate observation that retains the old UNKNOWN termination-unconfirmed status. GoalPhase kind source-history-recovery requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseSourceHistoryRecoveryDescriptionResult as request and GoalPhaseSourceHistoryRecoveryAnswer as result, with matching execution worker and actual reference, for a separately bound new normalization attempt. GoalPhase kind validation-recovery requires participant, the actual generated recovery description as request and a supplied GoalPhaseValidationRecoveryAnswer as result, with matching execution worker and actual reference. Decode the actual target and require its complete ordered description choices: AuthorizeNewAttempt and Defer for unknown/known-failed, or AuthorizeNewAttempt, LimitedRepair, Defer only for confirmed timeout. Reject LimitedRepair for non-timeout and any broadened, omitted or reordered supplied choices. Encode the exact independently observed Human target/answer/participant/reference binding; LimitedRepair only prepares bounded investigation authorization and grants no retry or Plan adoption. Preserve strict canonical timeout fields and independent issuer/time/provenance admission. GoalPhase kind remaining-plan-adoption requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseRemainingPlanDescriptionResult as request and GoalPhaseRemainingPlanAdoptionInput as result, with matching directive reference and execution worker. It encodes a separately observed new directive, never an answer to the old question. The trusted host remains responsible for real Human provenance and independent provisioning. Return existing structured datastore rows without provisioning or workflow transition. Supplied metadata grants no authority, and preparation alone grants no adoption, recovery or execution.

GoalPhase kind closure-recovery requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseClosureRecoveryDescriptionResult as request and GoalPhaseClosureRecoveryAnswer as result, matching execution worker and actual reference. Effect-bearing choices require affirmative priorExecutionEnded independently attested by the trusted production host from actual terminal old invocation evidence. Passive preparation verifies supplied typed binding only; it does not establish real process termination or grant recovery. Defer requires no prior-ended assertion. Ordinary recovery binds the entire exact target and current physical selection.

GoalPhase kind candidate-observation-continuation requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseCandidateObservationContinuationDescriptionResult and GoalPhaseCandidateObservationContinuationAnswer, matching execution worker and actual reference. The distinct independent purpose binds the complete prior UNKNOWN termination-unconfirmed chain, actual described repository/index snapshot and selected CNCF diff budget; trusted independent attestation owns snapshot and fresh Human provenance. No old candidate-recovery kind or purpose fallback is admitted, and preparation grants no direction or effect.

GoalPhase kind whole-phase-candidate-recovery requires participant, the actual GoalPhaseWholePhaseCandidateRecoveryDescriptionResult and GoalPhaseWholePhaseCandidateRecoveryAnswer, matching execution worker and actual reference. This separate passive preparation binds the exact original all-closed whole-Phase target and resolved policy. AuthorizeNewObservation requires priorExecutionEnded=true; the trusted independent provisioning host must have actually observed real terminal prior invocation evidence and the fresh Human answer. A supplied Boolean is not proof, and preparation does not establish termination, provision evidence, append direction or perform effects. Defer does not require ended=true.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

